{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772631941611,"story":{"title":"Sir Gus and Blue","userPrompt":"A knight and a donkey discovering the joy of reading together","authorStyleId":"margaret-wise-brown","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Sir Gus was brave. So brave and bold! But Gus felt sad. He felt quite cold.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, friendly knight, Sir Gus, in shining armor. He looks a bit lonely and downcast. Background: A gray stone castle with a blue sky peeking through. Colors: muted blues and grays, with a touch of bright gold on Gus's armor. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770182892008,"durationMs":6548,"retries":0,"promptLength":850,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short strawberry blonde hair in slightly messy, short, big-expressive bright blue eyes with sad, cold expression, wearing A slightly too-big suit of shining silver armor with a red tunic underneath. He wears brown leather boots., with A small, slightly dented silver helmet, a toy wooden sword strapped to his back., A smattering of freckles across his nose, a small gap between his two front teeth, slightly rosy cheeks, a small scratch on his left knee. Sir Gus standing alone in a meadow, looking downcast and shivering slightly. in A grassy meadow, perhaps with a few wildflowers.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Then Blue came by. A sweet, gray friend. \"Why so glum, Gus?\" Blue asked him then.","illustrationPrompt":"A kind-looking gray donkey, Blue, approaches Sir Gus. Blue has big, friendly eyes and a gentle smile. Background: A green meadow with colorful wildflowers. Colors: soft greens, blues, and yellows. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770182995880,"durationMs":3823,"retries":0,"promptLength":1230,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short strawberry blonde hair in slightly messy, short, big-expressive bright blue eyes with glum expression, wearing A slightly too-big suit of shining silver armor with a red tunic underneath. He wears brown leather boots., with A small, slightly dented silver helmet, a toy wooden sword strapped to his back., A smattering of freckles across his nose, a small gap between his two front teeth, slightly rosy cheeks, a small scratch on his left knee. A small fluffy light gray fur with a white patch on its chest bunny, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with concerned, sweet expression, wearing A small, blue vest made of soft felt with a single button. He also wears a pair of round spectacles perched on his nose., with Spectacles and Small satchel, Long, floppy ears, a twitching nose, large, fluffy tail, slightly buck teeth, fluffy build. Blue approaching Sir Gus, looking concerned. Blue is slightly larger than Sir Gus. in Grassy meadow, same as before.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Gus said, \"I'm bored! No fun to find! I wish I knew what's on my mind!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Gus looks up at Blue with a thoughtful expression. He scratches his chin. Blue listens patiently with a tilted head. Background: Focus on Gus and Blue, with a blurred meadow in the background. Colors: warm yellows and greens. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"gemini","generatedAt":1770183016643,"durationMs":5004,"retries":0,"promptLength":1212,"success":true,"